  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RtF &#x2013; Kenya IMPACT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT is the Reversing the Flow (RtF) hub in Kenya.Through the RtF programme, IMPACT aims for enhanced water security and climate resilience through contributing to sustainable landscape management by supporting locally-led action by grassroots organisations in three wards of Laikipia and Isiolo Counties (Mukogodo East, Mukogodo West in Laikipia County and Burat Ward).</narrative>
  </description>
